3. Do not invent minimums, maximums, decimals or cross-field calculations.
4. Do not add chronological or biological validation unrelated to visible pots information.
5. Restore saved values on GET and invalid POST.
6. Save valid values only after successful validation.
7. Continue to the next approved journey route.

